  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "入門者にオススメ！組み立ての順番を間違えても大丈夫！BANDAI SPIRITS公式の「パーツセパレーター」が登場！",
      "en": "Recommended for beginners! It's okay if the assembly order is wrong! BANDAI SPIRITS official \"parts separator\" is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデルメーカーのノウハウを結集。手に馴染み、使い勝手の良い形状を実現。",
      "en": "• Bringing together the know-how of plastic model manufacturers. It has a shape that fits comfortably in your hand and is easy to use."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 樹脂成形だからパーツを傷つけずに分解できる。",
      "en": "• Because it is resin molded, it can be disassembled without damaging the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ピンを差し込んで押し出すことでもパーツの分割が可能。",
      "en": "• Parts can also be separated by inserting and pushing out pins."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ポリキャップにピンを差し込めば、挟み込む際につぶれにくい。",
      "en": "• If you insert a pin into the polycap, it won't get crushed when you pinch it."
    }
  ],
